{
  "uid": "planazo-busqueda",
  "title": "Planazo - Búsqueda de actividades",
  "description": "Recorrido instrumentado de la Entrega 5: búsqueda de actividades (GET /activities).",
  "tags": [
    "planazo",
    "entrega-5"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Solicitudes por segundo (GET /activities)",
      "description": "Solicitudes HTTP de búsqueda de actividades que recibió el backend, por segundo. Fuente: http.server.request.duration del agente Java (cada solicitud es una observación del histograma).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "solicitudes/s",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Porcentaje de solicitudes fallidas",
      "description": "Porcentaje de solicitudes de búsqueda que terminaron en error del servidor (HTTP 5xx) sobre el total. Los rechazos del cliente (4xx, por ejemplo un rango de fechas inválido) se muestran aparte.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx (fallidas)",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\", http_response_status_code=~\"4..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx (rechazadas)",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo de respuesta p95 (GET /activities)",
      "description": "Percentil 95 del tiempo que el backend tarda en responder una búsqueda: el 95 % de las solicitudes del intervalo tardó menos que este valor. Se calcula con histogram_quantile sobre los buckets del histograma.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"/activities\", http_request_method=\"GET\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Búsquedas completadas por segundo",
      "description": "Búsquedas de actividades que terminaron bien y devolvieron una página, por segundo. Métrica manual planazo.activities.search.completed: una solicitud HTTP que falla no suma acá.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(planazo_activities_search_completed_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "búsquedas/s",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (search_filter_type) (rate(planazo_activities_search_completed_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "tipo {{search_filter_type}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo de acceso a la base p95 (búsqueda)",
      "description": "Percentil 95 de la duración de cada acceso a MongoDB de la búsqueda, por operación: find (la página), find_people (participantes y organizadores de la página) y count (el total). Métrica manual planazo.activities.search.db.duration. El count solo corre cuando la página no alcanza para saber el total y no hay uno reciente en caché, así que su serie tiene pocas muestras.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, db_operation_name) (rate(planazo_activities_search_db_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{db_operation_name}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
